## [upstream] multimin: add a quadratic minimiser

Commit: 53cd0d098

New `gsl_multimin_fminimizer_quadratic`, a derivative-free minimiser for
nearly quadratic functions.  It minimises along each coordinate in turn by
fitting a parabola through the current point and the two points one step
away, moving to the predicted minimum when it improves the value and halving
