Commit: d67eae92b (documentation: 6fa6706f4)

Savannah bug #66695 (2025) offers six explicit embedded Runge-Kutta
steppers that are common in the high-order literature but absent from
GSL:

    gsl_odeiv2_step_vern7, _vern8, _vern9       (Verner 7(6), 8(7), 9(8))
    gsl_odeiv2_step_feagin108, _1210, _1412     (Feagin 10(8), 12(10), 14(12))

