coefficients of `vern8` were compared element by element against
Verner's published floating-point file
`RKV87.IIa.Efficient.000000011182-240510`, and the Butcher order
conditions of the implemented main and embedded weights hold to order 8
and 7 respectively.  A convergence study on `y' = y` confirms the
expected orders for `vern7` (7.2), `vern9` (8.9) and `feagin1210`
